# Frontend Architecture & Implementation Plan

**Framework**: React 18 / 19 with Vite  
**Styling**: Tailwind CSS (with custom utility classes & modern design tokens)  
**State Management**: Redux Toolkit (`@reduxjs/toolkit` + `react-redux`)  
**Routing**: React Router DOM (v6 / v7 compatible)  
**HTTP Client**: Centralized Axios with request/response interceptors  
**Icons & Feedback**: React Icons (`react-icons`), React Hot Toast (`react-hot-toast`)  
**Target Backend**: FastAPI LMS on `http://127.0.0.1:8000`  

