## 3. UI/UX Design System & Color Palette

- **Theme**: Modern Enterprise Slate & Indigo
  - Primary: Deep Indigo / Violet (`#4F46E5`, `#4338CA`, `#3730A3`)
  - Accent / Status: Emerald green for active/passed/paid (`#10B981`), Amber for pending/draft/review (`#F59E0B`), Rose red for failed/dropped/absent (`#EF4444`), Sky blue for upcoming/info (`#0284C7`)
  - Backgrounds: Clean neutral canvas (`#F8FAFC` slate-50, `#FFFFFF` pure white cards with subtle borders `#E2E8F0`)
- **Typography**: Inter / System UI, high-contrast crisp readability, hierarchy from H1 to micro-labels.
- **Responsive Navigation**: Collapsible desktop sidebar with icon tooltips; drawer menu on tablet/mobile screens.
- **Micro-Interactions**: Hover lifts on metric cards, subtle button active states, smooth dropdown transitions, skeleton loaders for data fetching.

