## 4. Phased Implementation Roadmap

- **Phase 1: Backend Analysis & API Inventory** *(Completed)*
- **Phase 2: Implementation Plan & Architecture Alignment** *(Current step)*
- **Phase 3: Project Scaffolding & Setup**
  - Initialize Vite React project in `frontend/`.
  - Configure Tailwind CSS, PostCSS, Vite proxy, and dependencies (`react-router-dom`, `@reduxjs/toolkit`, `react-redux`, `axios`, `react-icons`, `react-hot-toast`).
- **Phase 4: Design System & Core Reusable Components**
  - Typography, standard buttons (primary, secondary, danger, ghost), form inputs, modal dialog, confirmation alert, badge, skeleton loader, and responsive data table with pagination and sorting.
- **Phase 5: Auth Shell & Routing Infrastructure**
  - Centralized Axios client (`api.js`) with request/response interceptors.
  - Redux `authSlice` with token re-hydration.
  - `AuthLayout`, `AppLayout`, `Navbar` (user menu, notification popover), `Sidebar` (role-scoped navigation items), `Footer`.
  - Public `/login`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password` pages.
- **Phase 6: Role Dashboards & Health Monitoring**
  - Dynamic Dashboard supporting Admin metrics (revenue, enrollments), Instructor metrics (submissions to grade, upcoming batches), and Student metrics (enrolled courses, attendance, upcoming deadlines).
- **Phase 7: Core Academic Modules**
  - Courses & Curriculum management (course list, add/edit course, modules builder, co-instructor assignment).
  - Batches & Rosters management (batch scheduling, capacity tracker, student roster addition & removal).
  - Enrollments (student enrollment workflow, status tracking).
- **Phase 8: Content & Assessment Modules**
  - Lectures & Video streaming / file uploads (lecture reordering, video upload, complete lecture button).
  - Study materials repository (file upload with MIME checking, direct download stream).
  - Assignments & Submissions (create assignment, student submission with file attachment, instructor grading rubric).
  - Quizzes & MCQs (quiz creation, question & MCQ options builder, student timed quiz runner, auto-grading results).
- **Phase 9: Operational Modules & Reports**
  - Attendance (bulk session attendance grid, audit logs modal with mandatory reason).
  - Fee Payments & Invoices (record payment installment, overpayment guard, PDF receipt download).
  - Certificates (auto-check course completion criteria, generate PDF, and public verification page `/verify-certificate/:code`).
  - Announcements & Notifications (broadcast announcement, unread badge, mark read).
  - Reports export (CSV, Excel, PDF table downloads).
- **Phase 10: Verification, Polishing & Production Build**
  - Verification of every flow with the live backend API.
  - Responsive layout checks across mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports.
  - Production build execution (`npm run build`) to ensure zero bundle/lint errors.
